The village is small, a handful of makeshift structures surrounding the oasis. You can see people going about their daily lives, tending crops and grazing animals, and children playing in the water. Despite the harsh desert climate, this oasis is an oasis of life, a refuge from the treacherous surroundings.
<br><br>
