<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave (0:05)|Desert Village]]>><</link>>

:: Island Dock
The dock is made of weathered wooden planks, with a few old and dilapidated fishing boats tied up alongside it. There's a strong scent of fish in the air, along with a hint of salt and decay.
<br><br>
You notice a few suspicious-looking characters loitering around the dock, whispering to each other and looking around nervously. They seem to be engaged in some sort of illegal activity, such as transporting illegal goods or substances. The dock seems to be a hub for criminal activity, and you should probably stay away from it.
<br><br>
<<link [[Look for a ride (0:20)|Desert Dock Ride]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave (0:05)|Desert Village]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Desert Dock Ride
<<generate1>><<person1>><<generate2>><<person2>><<generate3>><<person3>>
You ask some of the sketchy <<people>> on the dock about renting their vessel for a ride back to the mainland. They offer you a ride for a mere 500 pounds.
<br><br>
<<if $money gte 50000>>
<<link [[Accept payment|Take Off Island]]>><<set $money -= 50000>><<set $rng to random(1,100)>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Decline|Island Dock]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Take Off Island
You and the crew board the ship and take off to sea. You catch the sketchy <<people>> occasionally casting glances your way.
<br><br>
<<if $rng lte 50>>
As you look across the ocean sky you feel a hand land on your shoulder. You turn around and see the gang of sketchy <<people>>. “Excuse me little thing but you can't have thought 500 was enough for this trip. The rest we want as another form of payment.” <<He>> licks his lips as <<his>> gang pin you to the ground.
<br><br>
<<link [[Refuse|Boat Rape]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
The ride is fairly uneventful. The sketchy <<people>> give you cursory glances but in the end make no moves. You reach your location and dismount from the ship.
<br><br>
<<link [[Get Out|Docks]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

